<P><B>a</B> [14 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl120.htm">{{1200}}</A>  uṟā arkku uṟu nōy urippāy kaṭali+ ceṟā a ay vāḻiya neñcu
<li><A HREF="f_krl110.htm">{{1097}}</A>  ceṟā a+ ciṟu collum ceṟṟārpōl nōkkum uṟāar pōṉṟu uṟṟār kuṟippu
<li><A HREF="f_krl042.htm">{{0411}}</A>  celvattuḷ celvam cevi+ celvam a+ celvam celvattuḷ ellām tali
<li><A HREF="f_krl065.htm">{{0645}}</A>  colluka colli piṟitu ōr col a+ colli vellum col iṉmi aṟintu
<li><A HREF="f_krl068.htm">{{0671}}</A>  cūḻcci muṭivu tuṇivu eytal a+ tuṇivu tāḻcciyuḷ taṅkutal tītu
<li><A HREF="f_krl023.htm">{{0225}}</A>  āṟṟuvār āṟṟal paci āṟṟal a+ paciyi māṟṟuvār āṟṟaliṉ piṉ
<li><A HREF="f_krl048.htm">{{0475}}</A>  pīli pey cākāṭum accu iṟum a+ paṇṭam cāla mikuttu+ peyiṉ
<li><A HREF="f_krl035.htm">{{0350}}</A>  paṟṟuka paṟṟu aṟṟāṉ paṟṟiṉi a+ paṟṟi+ paṟṟuka paṟṟu viṭaṟku
<li><A HREF="f_krl095.htm">{{0950}}</A>  uṟṟavaṉ tīrppāṉ maruntu uḻiccelvāṉ eṉṟu a+ pāl nāṟ kūṟṟē maruntu
<li><A HREF="f_krl037.htm">{{0361}}</A>  avā eṉpa ellā uyirkkum eñ ñāṉṟum tavā a+ piṟappu īṉum vittu
<li><A HREF="f_krl131.htm">{{1301}}</A>  pullātu irā a+ pulatti avar uṟum allal nōy kāṇkam ciṟitu
<li><A HREF="f_krl043.htm">{{0423}}</A>  e+ poruḷ yār yār vāy+ kēṭpiṉum a+ poruḷ mey+ poruḷ kāṇpatu aṟivu
<li><A HREF="f_krl036.htm">{{0355}}</A>  e+ poruḷ e+ taṉmittu āyiṉum a+ poruḷ meypporuḷ kāṇpatu aṟivu
<li><A HREF="f_krl070.htm">{{0695}}</A>  e+ poruḷum ōrār toṭarār maṟṟu a+ poruḷi viṭṭakkāl kēṭka maṟi
</OL>


<P><B>aḵkāmi</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl018.htm">{{0178}}</A>  aḵkāmi celvattiṟku yātu eṉiṉ veḵkāmi vēṇṭum piṟaṉ ki+ poruḷ
</OL>


<P><B>aḵki</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl018.htm">{{0175}}</A>  aḵki akaṉṟa aṟivu eṉ ām yār māṭṭum veḵki veṟiya ceyiṉ
</OL>


<P><B>aḵtu</B> [29 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl117.htm">{{1166}}</A>  iṉpam kaṭal maṟṟu+ kāmam aḵtu aṭuṅkāl tuṉpam ataṉiṉ peritu
<li><A HREF="f_krl110.htm">{{1093}}</A>  nōkkiṉāḷ nōkki iṟiñciṉāḷ aḵtu avaḷ yāppiṉuḷ aṭṭiya nīr
<li><A HREF="f_krl043.htm">{{0427}}</A>  aṟivu uṭiyār āvatu aṟivār aṟivu ilār aḵtu aṟikallātavar
<li><A HREF="f_krl131.htm">{{1308}}</A>  nōtal evaṉ maṟṟu nontār eṉṟu aḵtu aṟiyum kātalar illāvaḻi
<li><A HREF="f_krl128.htm">{{1279}}</A>  toṭi nōkki meṉ tōḷum nōkki aṭi nōkki aḵtu āṇṭu avaḷ ceytatu
<li><A HREF="f_krl104.htm">{{1032}}</A>  uḻuvār ulakattārkku āṇi aḵtu āṟṟātu eḻuvāri ellām poṟuttu
<li><A HREF="f_krl058.htm">{{0572}}</A>  kaṇṇōṭṭattu uḷḷatu ulakiyal aḵtu ilār uṇmi nilakku+ poṟi
<li><A HREF="f_krl024.htm">{{0236}}</A>  tōṉṟiṉ pukaḻoṭu tōṉṟuka aḵtu ilār tōṉṟaliṉ tōṉṟāmi naṉṟu
<li><A HREF="f_krl027.htm">{{0262}}</A>  tavamum tavam uṭiyārkku ākum avam ataṉi aḵtu ilār mēṟkoḷvatu
<li><A HREF="f_krl008.htm">{{0080}}</A>  aṉpiṉ vaḻiyatu uyirnili aḵtu ilārkku eṉpu tōl pōrtta uṭampu
<li><A HREF="f_krl060.htm">{{0591}}</A>  uṭiyar eṉappaṭuvatu ūkkam aḵtu illār uṭiyatu uṭiyarō maṟṟu
<li><A HREF="f_krl017.htm">{{0170}}</A>  aḻukkaṟṟu akaṉṟārum illi aḵtu illār perukkattiṉ tīrntārum il
<li><A HREF="f_krl060.htm">{{0600}}</A>  uram oruvaṟku uḷḷa veṟukki aḵtu illār maram makkaḷ ātalē vēṟu
<li><A HREF="f_krl048.htm">{{0476}}</A>  nuṉi+ kompar ēṟiṉār aḵtu iṟantu ūkkiṉ uyirkku iṟuti āki viṭum
<li><A HREF="f_krl098.htm">{{0971}}</A>  oḷi oruvaṟku uḷḷa veṟukki iḷi oruvaṟku aḵtu iṟantu vāḻtum eṉal
<li><A HREF="f_krl102.htm">{{1014}}</A>  aṇi aṉṟē nāṇ uṭimi cāṉṟōrkku aḵtu iṉṟēl piṇi aṉṟē pīṭu naṭi
<li><A HREF="f_krl058.htm">{{0575}}</A>  kaṇṇiṟku aṇikalam kaṇṇōṭṭam aḵtu iṉṟēl puṇ eṉṟu uṇarappaṭum
<li><A HREF="f_krl056.htm">{{0556}}</A>  maṉṉarkku maṉṉutal ceṅkōṉmi aḵtu iṉṟēl maṉṉāvām maṉṉarkku oḷi
<li><A HREF="f_krl095.htm">{{0943}}</A>  aṟṟāl aḷavu aṟintu uṇka aḵtu uṭampu peṟṟāṉ neṭitu uykkum āṟu
<li><A HREF="f_krl037.htm">{{0368}}</A>  avā illārkku illārkum tuṉpam aḵtu uṇṭēl tavā atu mēṉmēl varum
<li><A HREF="f_krl101.htm">{{1001}}</A>  vittāṉ vāy cāṉṟa perum poruḷ aḵtu uṇṇāṉ cettāṉ ceyakkiṭantatu il
<li><A HREF="f_krl037.htm">{{0363}}</A>  vēṇṭāmi aṉṉa viḻu+ celvam īṇṭu illi yāṇṭum aḵtu oppatu il
<li><A HREF="f_krl054.htm">{{0536}}</A>  iḻukkāmi yār māṭṭum eṉṟum vaḻukkāmi vāyiṉ aḵtu oppatu il
<li><A HREF="f_krl063.htm">{{0621}}</A>  iṭukkaṇ varuṅkāl nakuka ataṉi aṭuttu ūrvatu aḵtu oppatu il
<li><A HREF="f_krl017.htm">{{0162}}</A>  viḻu+ pēṟṟiṉ aḵtu oppatu illi yār māṭṭum aḻukkāṟṟiṉ aṉmi peṟiṉ
<li><A HREF="f_krl042.htm">{{0414}}</A>  kaṟṟilaṉ āyiṉum kēṭka aḵtu oruvaṟku oṟkattiṉ ūṟṟu ām tuṇi
<li><A HREF="f_krl023.htm">{{0226}}</A>  aṟṟār aḻi paci tīrttal aḵtu oruvaṉ peṟṟāṉ poruḷ vippu uḻi
<li><A HREF="f_krl004.htm">{{0038}}</A>  vīḻ nāḷ paṭā ami naṉṟu āṟṟiṉ aḵtu oruvaṉ vāḻ nāḷ vaḻi aṭikkum kal
<li><A HREF="f_krl022.htm">{{0220}}</A>  oppuraviṉāl varum kēṭu eṉiṉ aḵtu oruvaṉ viṟṟu+ kōḷ takkatu uṭittu
</OL>


<P><B>aḵtum</B> [2 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl046.htm">{{0459}}</A>  maṉa nalattiṉ ākum maṟumi maṟṟu aḵtum iṉa nalattiṉ ēmāppu uṭittu
<li><A HREF="f_krl005.htm">{{0049}}</A>  aṟaṉ eṉappaṭṭatē il vāḻkki aḵtum piṟaṉ paḻippatu il āyiṉ naṉṟu
</OL>


<P><B>aḵtē</B> [3 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl008.htm">{{0076}}</A>  aṟattiṟkē aṉpu cārpu eṉpa aṟiyār maṟattiṟkum aḵtē tuṇi
<li><A HREF="f_krl014.htm">{{0132}}</A>  parintu ōmpi+ kākka oḻukkam terintu ōmpi+ tēriṉum aḵtē tuṇi
<li><A HREF="f_krl025.htm">{{0242}}</A>  nal āṟṟāṉ nāṭi aruḷ āḷka pal āṟṟāṉ tēriṉum aḵtē tuṇi
</OL>


<P><B>aka</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl108.htm">{{1074}}</A>  aka+ paṭṭi āvāri+ kāṇiṉ avariṉ mikappaṭṭu+ cemmākkum kīḻ
</OL>


<P><B>akaṭu</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl094.htm">{{0936}}</A>  akaṭu ārār allal uḻappar cūtu eṉṉum mukaṭiyāṉ mūṭappaṭṭār
</OL>


<P><B>akattatu</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl071.htm">{{0702}}</A>  aiyappaṭā atu akattatu uṇarvāṉi+ teyvattoṭu oppa+ koḷal
</OL>


<P><B>akattār</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl075.htm">{{0745}}</A>  koḷaṟku aritāy koṇṭa kūḻttu āki akattār nilikku eḷitu ām nīratu araṇ
</OL>


<P><B>akattāṉ</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl010.htm">{{0093}}</A>  mukattāṉ amarntu iṉitu nōkki akattāṉ ām iṉ coliṉatē aṟam
</OL>


<P><B>akattu</B> [9 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl033.htm">{{0329}}</A>  koli viṉiyar ākiya mākkaḷ puli viṉiyar puṉmi terivār akattu
<li><A HREF="f_krl070.htm">{{0694}}</A>  cevi+ collum cērnta nakiyum avittu oḻukal āṉṟa periyār akattu
<li><A HREF="f_krl072.htm">{{0717}}</A>  kaṟṟu aṟintār kalvi viḷaṅkum kacaṭu aṟa+ col terital vallār akattu
<li><A HREF="f_krl118.htm">{{1180}}</A>  maṟi peṟal ūrārkku aritu aṉṟāl empōl aṟi paṟi kaṇṇār akattu
<li><A HREF="f_krl131.htm">{{1305}}</A>  nalattaki nallavarkku ēer pula+ taki pū aṉṉa kaṇṇār akattu
<li><A HREF="f_krl008.htm">{{0078}}</A>  aṉpu akattu illā uyir vāḻkki vaṉpāṟkaṇ vaṟṟal maram taḷirttaṟṟu
<li><A HREF="f_krl102.htm">{{1020}}</A>  nāṇ akattu illār iyakkam marappāvi nāṇāl uyir maruṭṭiyaṟṟu
<li><A HREF="f_krl083.htm">{{0824}}</A>  mukattiṉ iṉiya nakāa akattu iṉṉā vañcari añcappaṭum
<li><A HREF="f_krl008.htm">{{0079}}</A>  puṟattu uṟuppu ellām evaṉ ceyyum yākki akattu uṟuppu aṉpu ilavarkku
</OL>


<P><B>akattē</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl028.htm">{{0271}}</A>  vañca maṉattāṉ paṭiṟṟu oḻukkam pūtaṅkaḷ aintum akattē nakum
</OL>


<P><B>akam</B> [5 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl028.htm">{{0277}}</A>  puṟam kuṉṟi kaṇṭaṉiyarēṉum akam kuṉṟi mūkkiṉ kariyār uṭittu
<li><A HREF="f_krl030.htm">{{0298}}</A>  puṟam tūymi nīrāṉ amiyum akam tūymi vāymiyāṉ kāṇappaṭum
<li><A HREF="f_krl079.htm">{{0786}}</A>  mukam naka naṭpatu naṭpu aṉṟu neñcattu akam naka naṭpatu naṭpu
<li><A HREF="f_krl083.htm">{{0830}}</A>  paki naṭpu ām kālam varuṅkāl mukam naṭṭu akam naṭpu orīi viṭal
<li><A HREF="f_krl071.htm">{{0708}}</A>  mukam nōkki niṟka amiyum akam nōkki uṟṟatu uṇarvār+ peṟiṉ
</OL>


<P><B>akaram</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl001.htm">{{0001}}</A>  akaram mutala eḻuttu ellām āti pakavaṉ mutaṟṟē ulaku
</OL>


<P><B>akal</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl003.htm">{{0025}}</A>  aintu avittāṉ āṟṟal akal vicumpuḷār kōmāṉ intiraṉē cālum kari
</OL>


<P><B>akalam</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl075.htm">{{0743}}</A>  uyarvu akalam tiṇmi arumi in nāṉkiṉ amivu araṇ eṉṟu urikkum nūl
</OL>


<P><B>akalākkaṭi</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl048.htm">{{0478}}</A>  āku āṟu aḷavu iṭṭitu āyiṉum kēṭu illi pōku āṟu akalākkaṭi
</OL>


<P><B>akalāta</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl123.htm">{{1226}}</A>  māli nōy ceytal maṇantār akalāta kāli aṟintatilēṉ
</OL>


<P><B>akalātu</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl070.htm">{{0691}}</A>  akalātu aṇukātu tī+ kāyvār pōlka ikal vēntar+ cērntu oḻukuvār
</OL>


<P><B>akaḻvāri</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl016.htm">{{0151}}</A>  akaḻvāri+ tāṅkum nilam pōla tammi ikaḻvār+ poṟuttal tali
</OL>


<P><B>akaṟaliṉ</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl133.htm">{{1325}}</A>  tavaṟu ilar āyiṉum tām vīḻvār meṉ tōḷ akaṟaliṉ āṅku oṉṟu uṭittu
</OL>


<P><B>akaṟṟum</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl038.htm">{{0372}}</A>  pēti+ paṭukkum iḻavu ūḻ aṟivu akaṟṟum ākal ūḻ uṟṟakkaṭi
</OL>


<P><B>akaṉ</B> [2 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl010.htm">{{0092}}</A>  akaṉ amarntu ītaliṉ naṉṟē mukaṉ amarntu iṉcolaṉ ākappeṟiṉ
<li><A HREF="f_krl009.htm">{{0084}}</A>  akaṉ amarntu ceyyāḷ uṟiyum mukaṉ amarntu nal viruntu ōmpuvāṉ il
</OL>


<P><B>akaṉṟa</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl018.htm">{{0175}}</A>  aḵki akaṉṟa aṟivu eṉ ām yār māṭṭum veḵki veṟiya ceyiṉ
</OL>


<P><B>akaṉṟārum</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl017.htm">{{0170}}</A>  aḻukkaṟṟu akaṉṟārum illi aḵtu illār perukkattiṉ tīrntārum il
</OL>


<P><B>akkaṭi</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl106.htm">{{1059}}</A>  īvārkaṇ eṉ uṇṭām tōṟṟam irantu kōḷ mēvār ilā akkaṭi
</OL>


<P><B>akkaṇṇum</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl032.htm">{{0312}}</A>  kaṟuttu iṉṉā ceyta akkaṇṇum maṟuttu iṉṉā ceyyāmi mācu aṟṟār kōḷ
</OL>


<P><B>aṅkaṇattuḷ</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl072.htm">{{0720}}</A>  aṅkaṇattuḷ ukka amiḻtu aṟṟāl tam kaṇattar allārmuṉ kōṭṭi koḷal
</OL>


<P><B>acāvāmi</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl062.htm">{{0611}}</A>  arumi uṭittu eṉṟu acāvāmi vēṇṭum perumi muyaṟci tarum
</OL>


<P><B>acii</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl104.htm">{{1040}}</A>  ilam eṉṟu acii iruppāri+ kāṇiṉ nilam eṉṉum nallāḷ nakum
</OL>


<P><B>aciyiyaṟku</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl110.htm">{{1098}}</A>  aciyiyaṟku uṇṭu āṇṭu ōr ēer yāṉ nōkka paciyiṉaḷ piya nakum
</OL>


<P><B>acivu</B> [2 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl060.htm">{{0594}}</A>  ākkam atar viṉāy+ cellum acivu ilā ūkkam uṭiyāṉuḻi
<li><A HREF="f_krl038.htm">{{0371}}</A>  āku ūḻāl tōṉṟum acivu iṉmi kipporuḷ pōku ūḻāl tōṉṟum maṭi
</OL>


<P><B>accam</B> [3 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl054.htm">{{0534}}</A>  accam uṭiyārkku araṇ illi āṅku illi poccāppu uṭiyārkku naṉku
<li><A HREF="f_krl051.htm">{{0501}}</A>  aṟam poruḷ iṉpam uyir accam nāṉkiṉ tiṟam terintu tēṟappaṭum
<li><A HREF="f_krl015.htm">{{0146}}</A>  paki pāvam accam paḻi eṉa nāṉkum ikavā ām il iṟappāṉkaṇ
</OL>


<P><B>accamē</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl108.htm">{{1075}}</A>  accamē kīḻkaḷatu ācāram eccam avā uṇṭēl uṇṭām ciṟitu
</OL>


<P><B>accu</B> [2 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl067.htm">{{0667}}</A>  uruvu kaṇṭu eḷḷāmi vēṇṭum uruḷ perun tērkku accu āṇi aṉṉār uṭittu
<li><A HREF="f_krl048.htm">{{0475}}</A>  pīli pey cākāṭum accu iṟum a+ paṇṭam cāla mikuttu+ peyiṉ
</OL>


<P><B>añar</B> [2 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl118.htm">{{1179}}</A>  vārākkāl tuñcā variṉ tuñcā āyiṭi ār añar uṟṟaṉa kaṇ
<li><A HREF="f_krl109.htm">{{1086}}</A>  koṭum puruvam kōṭā maṟippiṉ naṭuṅku añar ceyyalamaṉ ivaḷ kaṇ
</OL>


<P><B>añcappaṭum</B> [2 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl021.htm">{{0202}}</A>  tīyavi tīya payattalāṉ tīyavi tīyiṉum añcappaṭum
<li><A HREF="f_krl083.htm">{{0824}}</A>  mukattiṉ iṉiya nakāa akattu iṉṉā vañcari añcappaṭum
</OL>


<P><B>añcal</B> [3 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl043.htm">{{0428}}</A>  añcuvatu añcāmi pētimi añcuvatu añcal aṟivār toḻil
<li><A HREF="f_krl116.htm">{{1154}}</A>  aḷittu añcal eṉṟavar nīppiṉ teḷitta col tēṟiyārkku uṇṭō tavaṟu
<li><A HREF="f_krl115.htm">{{1149}}</A>  alar nāṇa olvatō añcal ōmpu eṉṟār palar nāṇa nīttakkaṭi
</OL>


<P><B>añcaṟka</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl089.htm">{{0882}}</A>  vāḷpōl pakivari añcaṟka añcuka kēḷpōl pakivar toṭarpu
</OL>


<P><B>añcā</B> [5 occ.]
<OL>
