<li><A HREF="f_krl007.htm">{{0063}}</A>  tam poruḷ eṉpa tam makkaḷ avar poruḷ tamtam viṉiyāṉ varum
<li><A HREF="f_krl007.htm">{{0066}}</A>  kuḻal iṉitu yāḻ iṉitu eṉpa tam makkaḷ maḻali+ col kēḷātavar
<li><A HREF="f_krl078.htm">{{0773}}</A>  pēr āṇmi eṉpa taṟukaṇ oṉṟu uṟṟakkāl ūrāṇmi maṟṟu ataṉ eḵku
<li><A HREF="f_krl025.htm">{{0244}}</A>  maṉ uyir ōmpi aruḷ āḷvāṟku il eṉpa taṉ uyir añcum viṉi
