<li><A HREF="f_krl074.htm">{{0739}}</A>  nāṭu eṉpa nāṭā vaḷattaṉa nāṭu alla nāṭa vaḷam tarum nāṭu
<li><A HREF="f_krl074.htm">{{0738}}</A>  piṇi iṉmi celvam viḷivu iṉpam ēmam aṇi eṉpa nāṭṭiṟku iv aintu
<li><A HREF="f_krl074.htm">{{0736}}</A>  kēṭu aṟiyā keṭṭa iṭattum vaḷam kuṉṟā nāṭu eṉpa nāṭṭiṉ tali
<li><A HREF="f_krl062.htm">{{0617}}</A>  maṭi uḷāḷ mā mukaṭi eṉpa maṭi ilāṉ tāḷ uḷāḷ tāmariyiṉāḷ
<li><A HREF="f_krl006.htm">{{0060}}</A>  maṅkalam eṉpa maṉimāṭci maṟṟu ataṉ naṉkalam naṉ makkaṭ pēṟu
<li><A HREF="f_krl092.htm">{{0918}}</A>  āyum aṟiviṉar allārkku aṇaṅku eṉpa māya makaḷir muyakku
<li><A HREF="f_krl100.htm">{{0991}}</A>  eṇ patattāl eytal eḷitu eṉpa yārmāṭṭum paṇpu uṭimi eṉṉum vaḻakku
