<li><A HREF="f_krl081.htm">{{0803}}</A>  paḻakiya naṭpu evaṉ ceyyum keḻutakimi ceytāṅku amiyākkaṭi
<li><A HREF="f_krl081.htm">{{0802}}</A>  naṭpiṟku uṟuppu+ keḻutakimi maṟṟu ataṟku uppu ātal cāṉṟōr kaṭaṉ
<li><A HREF="f_krl081.htm">{{0808}}</A>  kēḷ iḻukkam kēḷā+ keḻutakimi vallārkku nāḷ iḻukkam naṭṭār ceyiṉ
</OL>


<P><B>keḻutakiyāṉ</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl081.htm">{{0804}}</A>  viḻitakiyāṉ vēṇṭiyiruppar keḻutakiyāṉ kēḷātu naṭṭār ceyiṉ
</OL>


<P><B>kēṭaṉ</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl021.htm">{{0210}}</A>  aruṅ kēṭaṉ eṉpatu aṟika maruṅku ōṭi+ tīviṉi ceyyāṉ eṉiṉ
</OL>


<P><B>kēṭu</B> [14 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl004.htm">{{0032}}</A>  aṟattiṉ ūuṅku ākkamum illi ataṉi maṟattaliṉ ūṅku illi kēṭu
<li><A HREF="f_krl021.htm">{{0204}}</A>  maṟantum piṟaṉ kēṭu cūḻaṟka cūḻiṉ aṟam cūḻum cūḻntavaṉ kēṭu
<li><A HREF="f_krl086.htm">{{0858}}</A>  ikaliṟku etir cāytal ākkam ataṉi mikal ūkkiṉ ūkkumām kēṭu
<li><A HREF="f_krl089.htm">{{0889}}</A>  eṭ pakavu aṉṉa ciṟumittē āyiṉum uṭpaki uḷḷatu ām kēṭu
<li><A HREF="f_krl074.htm">{{0736}}</A>  kēṭu aṟiyā keṭṭa iṭattum vaḷam kuṉṟā nāṭu eṉpa nāṭṭiṉ tali
<li><A HREF="f_krl040.htm">{{0400}}</A>  kēṭu il viḻu+ celvam kalvi oruvaṟku māṭu alla maṟṟiyavi
<li><A HREF="f_krl080.htm">{{0791}}</A>  nāṭātu naṭṭaliṉ kēṭu illi naṭṭapiṉ vīṭu illi naṭpu āḷpavarkku
<li><A HREF="f_krl048.htm">{{0478}}</A>  āku āṟu aḷavu iṭṭitu āyiṉum kēṭu illi pōku āṟu akalākkaṭi
<li><A HREF="f_krl017.htm">{{0165}}</A>  aḻukkāṟu uṭiyārkku atu cālum oṉṉār vaḻukkiyum kēṭu īṉpatu
<li><A HREF="f_krl022.htm">{{0220}}</A>  oppuraviṉāl varum kēṭu eṉiṉ aḵtu oruvaṉ viṟṟu+ kōḷ takkatu uṭittu
<li><A HREF="f_krl021.htm">{{0204}}</A>  maṟantum piṟaṉ kēṭu cūḻaṟka cūḻiṉ aṟam cūḻum cūḻntavaṉ kēṭu
<li><A HREF="f_krl086.htm">{{0859}}</A>  ikalkāṇāṉ ākkam varuṅkāl ataṉi mikal kāṇum kēṭu taraṟku
<li><A HREF="f_krl070.htm">{{0700}}</A>  paḻiyam eṉa+ karuti paṇpu alla ceyyum keḻutakimi kēṭu tarum
<li><A HREF="f_krl031.htm">{{0307}}</A>  ciṉatti+ poruḷ eṉṟu koṇṭavaṉ kēṭu nilattu aṟintāṉ ki piḻiyātaṟṟu
</OL>


<P><B>kēṭum</B> [4 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl065.htm">{{0642}}</A>  ākkamum kēṭum ataṉāl varutalāl kāttu ōmpal colliṉkaṇ cōrvu
<li><A HREF="f_krl024.htm">{{0235}}</A>  nattam pōl kēṭum uḷatākum cākkāṭum vittakarkku allāl aritu
<li><A HREF="f_krl017.htm">{{0169}}</A>  avviya neñcattāṉ ākkamum cevviyāṉ kēṭum niṉikkappaṭum
<li><A HREF="f_krl012.htm">{{0115}}</A>  kēṭum perukkamum il alla neñcattu+ kōṭāmi cāṉṟōrkku aṇi
</OL>


<P><B>kēṭka</B> [4 occ.]
<OL>
