<li><A HREF="f_krl042.htm">{{0416}}</A>  eṉittāṉum nallavi kēṭka aṉittāṉum āṉṟa perumi tarum
<li><A HREF="f_krl070.htm">{{0695}}</A>  e+ poruḷum ōrār toṭarār maṟṟu a+ poruḷi viṭṭakkāl kēṭka maṟi
<li><A HREF="f_krl059.htm">{{0587}}</A>  maṟintavi kēṭka vaṟṟu āki aṟintavi aiyappāṭu illatē oṟṟu
</OL>


