<li><A HREF="f_krl108.htm">{{1076}}</A>  aṟi paṟi aṉṉar kayavar tām kēṭṭa maṟi piṟarkku uyttu urikkalāṉ
</OL>


<P><B>kēṭṭal</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl007.htm">{{0065}}</A>  makkaḷ mey tīṇṭal uṭaṟku iṉpam maṟṟu avar col kēṭṭal iṉpam cevikku
</OL>


<P><B>kēṭṭār</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl065.htm">{{0643}}</A>  kēṭṭār+ piṇikkum taki avāy kēḷārum vēṭpa moḻivatu ām col
</OL>


<P><B>kēṭṭāl</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl074.htm">{{0732}}</A>  perum poruḷāṉ peṭṭakkatu āki aruṅ kēṭṭāl āṟṟa viḷivatu nāṭu
</OL>


<P><B>kēṭṭiṉum</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl080.htm">{{0796}}</A>  kēṭṭiṉum uṇṭu ōr uṟuti kiḷiñari nīṭṭi aḷappatu ōr kōl
</OL>


<P><B>kēṭṭu</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl111.htm">{{1101}}</A>  kaṇṭu kēṭṭu uṇṭu uyirttu uṟṟu aṟiyum aimpulaṉum oṇṭoṭikaṇṇē uḷa
</OL>


<P><B>kēṭpar</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl061.htm">{{0607}}</A>  iṭi purintu eḷḷum col kēṭpar maṭi purintu māṇṭa uñaṟṟu ilavar
</OL>


<P><B>kēṭpiṉum</B> [3 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl043.htm">{{0423}}</A>  e+ poruḷ yār yār vāy+ kēṭpiṉum a+ poruḷ mey+ poruḷ kāṇpatu aṟivu
<li><A HREF="f_krl042.htm">{{0418}}</A>  kēṭpiṉum kēḷā+ takiyavē kēḷviyāl tōṭka+ paṭāta cevi
<li><A HREF="f_krl070.htm">{{0697}}</A>  vēṭpaṉa colli viṉi ila eññāṉṟum kēṭpiṉum collā viṭal
</OL>


<P><B>kēṇi</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
