<li><A HREF="f_krl019.htm">{{0187}}</A>  paka+ colli+ kēḷir+ pirippar naka+ colli naṭpu āṭal tēṟṟātavar
<li><A HREF="f_krl127.htm">{{1267}}</A>  pulappēṉkol pulluvēṉ kollō kalappēṉkol kaṇ aṉṉa kēḷir variṉ
