<P><B>kēḷpōl</B> [2 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl089.htm">{{0882}}</A>  vāḷpōl pakivari añcaṟka añcuka kēḷpōl pakivar toṭarpu
<li><A HREF="f_krl123.htm">{{1222}}</A>  puṉkaṇṇi vāḻi maruḷ māli em kēḷpōl vaṉkaṇṇatō niṉ tuṇi
