<li><A HREF="f_krl045.htm">{{0442}}</A>  uṟṟa nōy nīkki uṟā ami muṉ kākkum peṟṟiyār+ pēṇi+ koḷal
<li><A HREF="f_krl045.htm">{{0443}}</A>  ariyavaṟṟuḷ ellām aritē periyāri+ pēṇi+ tamarā+ koḷal
<li><A HREF="f_krl045.htm">{{0445}}</A>  cūḻvār kaṇ āka ōḻukalāṉ maṉṉavaṉ cūḻvāri+ cūḻntu koḷal
<li><A HREF="f_krl051.htm">{{0504}}</A>  kuṇam nāṭi kuṟṟamum nāṭi avaṟṟuḷ miki nāṭi mikka koḷal
<li><A HREF="f_krl053.htm">{{0530}}</A>  uḻi+ pirintu kāraṇattiṉ vantāṉi vēntaṉ iḻittu iruntu eṇṇi+ koḷal
<li><A HREF="f_krl059.htm">{{0588}}</A>  oṟṟu oṟṟi+ tanta poruḷiyum maṟṟum ōr oṟṟiṉāl oṟṟi koḷal
<li><A HREF="f_krl068.htm">{{0677}}</A>  ceyviṉi ceyvāṉ ceyalmuṟi av viṉi uḷ aṟivāṉ uḷḷam koḷal
<li><A HREF="f_krl068.htm">{{0679}}</A>  naṭṭārkku nalla ceyaliṉ virintatē oṭṭāri oṭṭi+ koḷal
<li><A HREF="f_krl071.htm">{{0702}}</A>  aiyappaṭā atu akattatu uṇarvāṉi+ teyvattoṭu oppa+ koḷal
<li><A HREF="f_krl071.htm">{{0703}}</A>  kuṟippiṉ kuṟippu uṇarvāri uṟuppiṉuḷ yātu koṭuttum koḷal
<li><A HREF="f_krl072.htm">{{0714}}</A>  oḷiyārmuṉ oḷḷiyar ātal veḷiyārmuṉ vāṉ cuti vaṇṇam koḷal
<li><A HREF="f_krl072.htm">{{0720}}</A>  aṅkaṇattuḷ ukka amiḻtu aṟṟāl tam kaṇattar allārmuṉ kōṭṭi koḷal
<li><A HREF="f_krl073.htm">{{0724}}</A>  kaṟṟār muṉ kaṟṟa cela+ colli tām kaṟṟa mikkāruḷ mikka koḷal
<li><A HREF="f_krl080.htm">{{0795}}</A>  aḻa+ colli allatu iṭittu vaḻakku aṟiya vallār naṭpu āyntu koḷal
<li><A HREF="f_krl093.htm">{{0925}}</A>  ki aṟiyāmi uṭittē poruḷ koṭuttu mey aṟiyāmi koḷal
<li><A HREF="f_krl099.htm">{{0986}}</A>  cālpiṟku+ kaṭṭaḷi yātu eṉiṉ tōlvi tuli allārkaṇṇum koḷal
<li><A HREF="f_krl103.htm">{{1026}}</A>  nal āṇmi eṉpatu oruvaṟku+ tāṉ piṟanta il āṇmi ākki+ koḷal
<li><A HREF="f_krl014.htm">{{0134}}</A>  maṟappiṉum ottu+ koḷal ākum pārppāṉ piṟappu oḻukkam kuṉṟa+ keṭum
<li><A HREF="f_krl023.htm">{{0222}}</A>  nallāṟu eṉiṉum koḷal tītu mēl ulakam il eṉiṉum ītalē naṉṟu
<li><A HREF="f_krl080.htm">{{0794}}</A>  kuṭi+ piṟantu taṉkaṇ paḻi nāṇuvāṉi+ koṭuttum koḷal vēṇṭum naṭpu
</OL>


