<li><A HREF="f_krl036.htm">{{0351}}</A>  poruḷ allavaṟṟi+ poruḷ eṉṟu uṇarum maruḷāṉ ām māṇa+ piṟappu
<li><A HREF="f_krl036.htm">{{0357}}</A>  ōrttu uḷḷam uḷḷatu uṇariṉ oru taliyā pērttu uḷḷavēṇṭā piṟappu
<li><A HREF="f_krl101.htm">{{1002}}</A>  poruḷāṉ ām ellām eṉṟu īyātu ivaṟum maruḷāṉ ām māṇa+ piṟappu
<li><A HREF="f_krl035.htm">{{0345}}</A>  maṟṟum toṭarppāṭu evaṉkol piṟappu aṟukkal uṟṟārkku uṭampum miki
<li><A HREF="f_krl035.htm">{{0349}}</A>  paṟṟu aṟṟakaṇṇē piṟappu aṟukkum maṟṟum niliyāmi kāṇappaṭum
<li><A HREF="f_krl014.htm">{{0133}}</A>  oḻukkam uṭimi kuṭimi iḻukkam iḻinta piṟappu* āy viṭum
<li><A HREF="f_krl037.htm">{{0361}}</A>  avā eṉpa ellā uyirkkum eñ ñāṉṟum tavā a+ piṟappu īṉum vittu
<li><A HREF="f_krl036.htm">{{0358}}</A>  piṟappu eṉṉum pētimi nīṅka ciṟappu eṉṉum cemporuḷ kāṇpatu aṟivu
<li><A HREF="f_krl098.htm">{{0972}}</A>  piṟappu okkum ellā uyirkkum ciṟappu ovvā ceytoḻil vēṟṟumiyāṉ
<li><A HREF="f_krl014.htm">{{0134}}</A>  maṟappiṉum ottu+ koḷal ākum pārppāṉ piṟappu oḻukkam kuṉṟa+ keṭum
</OL>


<P><B>piṟappum</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl011.htm">{{0107}}</A>  eḻumi eḻu piṟappum uḷḷuvar tamkaṇ viḻumam tuṭittavar naṭpu
</OL>


<P><B>piṟamaṉ</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl111.htm">{{1102}}</A>  piṇikku maruntu piṟamaṉ aṇiyiḻi taṉ nōykku+ tāṉē maruntu
</OL>


<P><B>piṟar</B> [7 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl101.htm">{{1009}}</A>  aṉpu orīi taṟ ceṟṟu aṟam nōkkātu īṭṭiya oṇ poruḷ koḷvār piṟar
<li><A HREF="f_krl044.htm">{{0436}}</A>  taṉ kuṟṟam nīkki piṟar kuṟṟam kāṇkiṟpiṉ eṉ kuṟṟam ākum iṟikku
<li><A HREF="f_krl065.htm">{{0646}}</A>  vēṭpa+ tām colli piṟar col payaṉ kōṭal māṭciyiṉ mācu aṟṟār kōḷ
<li><A HREF="f_krl016.htm">{{0160}}</A>  uṇṇātu nōṟpār periyar piṟar collum iṉṉā+ col nōṟpāriṉ piṉ
<li><A HREF="f_krl099.htm">{{0984}}</A>  kollā nalattatu nōṉmi piṟar tīmi collā nalattatu cālpu
<li><A HREF="f_krl102.htm">{{1018}}</A>  piṟar nāṇattakkatu tāṉ nāṇāṉ āyiṉ aṟam nāṇa+ takkatu uṭittu
<li><A HREF="f_krl102.htm">{{1015}}</A>  piṟar paḻiyum tam paḻiyum nāṇuvār nāṇukku uṟipati eṉṉum ulaku
</OL>


<P><B>piṟarkaṇ</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl021.htm">{{0206}}</A>  tī+ pāla tāṉ piṟarkaṇ ceyyaṟka nōy+ pāla taṉṉi aṭal vēṇṭātāṉ
</OL>


<P><B>piṟarkku</B> [5 occ.]
<OL>
