<li><A HREF="f_krl032.htm">{{0311}}</A>  ciṟappu īṉum celvam peṟiṉum piṟarkku iṉṉā ceyyāmi mācu aṟṟār kōḷ
<li><A HREF="f_krl032.htm">{{0319}}</A>  piṟarkku iṉṉā muṟpakal ceyyiṉ tamakku iṉṉā piṟpakal tāmē varum
<li><A HREF="f_krl108.htm">{{1076}}</A>  aṟi paṟi aṉṉar kayavar tām kēṭṭa maṟi piṟarkku uyttu urikkalāṉ
<li><A HREF="f_krl084.htm">{{0834}}</A>  ōti uṇarntum piṟarkku urittum tāṉ aṭaṅkā+ pētiyiṉ pētiyār il
