<P><B>pīṭu</B> [4 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl097.htm">{{0968}}</A>  maruntō maṟṟu ūṉ ōmpum vāḻkki peruntakimi pīṭu aḻiya vanta iṭattu
<li><A HREF="f_krl103.htm">{{1021}}</A>  karumam ceya oruvaṉ kitūvēṉ eṉṉum perumiyiṉ pīṭu uṭiyatu il
<li><A HREF="f_krl006.htm">{{0059}}</A>  pukaḻ purinta il ilōrkku illi ikaḻvārmuṉ ēṟupōl pīṭu naṭi
<li><A HREF="f_krl102.htm">{{1014}}</A>  aṇi aṉṟē nāṇ uṭimi cāṉṟōrkku aḵtu iṉṟēl piṇi aṉṟē pīṭu naṭi
</OL>


<P><B>pīli</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl048.htm">{{0475}}</A>  pīli pey cākāṭum accu iṟum a+ paṇṭam cāla mikuttu+ peyiṉ
