<P><B>pukaḻntavi</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl054.htm">{{0538}}</A>  pukaḻntavi pōṟṟi+ ceyal vēṇṭum ceyyātu ikaḻntārkku eḻumiyum il
</OL>


<P><B>pukaḻpaṭa</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl024.htm">{{0237}}</A>  pukaḻpaṭa vāḻātār tam nōvār tammi ikaḻvāri nōvatu evaṉ
</OL>


<P><B>pukaḻmi</B> [1 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl054.htm">{{0533}}</A>  poccāppārkku illi pukaḻmi atu ulakattu e+ pāl nūlōrkkum tuṇivu
