<P><B>pukutti</B> [2 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl061.htm">{{0608}}</A>  maṭimi kuṭimikkaṇ taṅkiṉ taṉ oṉṉārkku aṭimi pukutti viṭum
<li><A HREF="f_krl062.htm">{{0616}}</A>  muyaṟci tiruviṉi ākkum muyaṟṟu iṉmi iṉmi pukutti viṭum
