<P><B>puṉ</B> [6 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl008.htm">{{0071}}</A>  aṉpiṟkum uṇṭō aṭikkum tāḻ ārvalar puṉ kaṇīr pūcal tarum
<li><A HREF="f_krl082.htm">{{0815}}</A>  ceytu ēmam cārā ciṟiyavar puṉ kēṇmi eytaliṉ eytāmi naṉṟu
<li><A HREF="f_krl019.htm">{{0189}}</A>  aṟaṉ nōkki āṟṟum kol viyam puṟaṉ nōkki+ puṉ col urippāṉ poṟi
<li><A HREF="f_krl092.htm">{{0914}}</A>  poruṭporuḷār puṉ nalam tōyār aruṭ poruḷ āyum aṟiviṉavar
<li><A HREF="f_krl092.htm">{{0915}}</A>  potu nalattār puṉ nalam tōyār mati nalattiṉ māṇṭa aṟiviṉavar
<li><A HREF="f_krl092.htm">{{0916}}</A>  tam nalam pārippār tōyār taki cerukki puṉ nalam pārippār tōḷ
