<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl074.htm">{{0737}}</A>  iru puṉalum vāynta maliyum varu puṉalum val araṇum nāṭṭiṟku uṟuppu
<li><A HREF="f_krl074.htm">{{0737}}</A>  iru puṉalum vāynta maliyum varu puṉalum val araṇum nāṭṭiṟku uṟuppu
