<P><B>peritu</B> [11 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl011.htm">{{0102}}</A>  kālattiṉāl ceyta naṉṟi ciṟitu eṉiṉum ñālattiṉ māṇa+ peritu
