<li><A HREF="f_krl013.htm">{{0124}}</A>  niliyiṉ tiriyātu aṭaṅkiyāṉ tōṟṟam maliyiṉum māṇa+ peritu
<li><A HREF="f_krl110.htm">{{1092}}</A>  kaṇ kaḷavu koḷḷum ciṟu nōkkam kāmattiṉ cempākam aṉṟu peritu
<li><A HREF="f_krl117.htm">{{1166}}</A>  iṉpam kaṭal maṟṟu+ kāmam aḵtu aṭuṅkāl tuṉpam ataṉiṉ peritu
<li><A HREF="f_krl128.htm">{{1272}}</A>  kaṇ niṟinta kāriki kāmpu ēr tōḷ pētikku+ peṇ niṟinta nīrmi peritu
