<li><A HREF="f_krl018.htm">{{0173}}</A>  ciṟṟiṉpam veḵki aṟaṉ alla ceyyārē maṟṟu iṉpam vēṇṭupavar
<li><A HREF="f_krl036.htm">{{0356}}</A>  kaṟṟu īṇṭu meypporuḷ kaṇṭār talippaṭuvar maṟṟu īṇṭu vārā neṟi
<li><A HREF="f_krl097.htm">{{0968}}</A>  maruntō maṟṟu ūṉ ōmpum vāḻkki peruntakimi pīṭu aḻiya vanta iṭattu
<li><A HREF="f_krl091.htm">{{0905}}</A>  illāḷi añcuvāṉ añcum maṟṟu eññāṉṟum nallārkku nalla ceyal
<li><A HREF="f_krl023.htm">{{0221}}</A>  vaṟiyārkku oṉṟu īvatē īki maṟṟu ellām kuṟiyetirppi nīratu uṭittu
<li><A HREF="f_krl104.htm">{{1033}}</A>  uḻutu uṇṭu vāḻvārē vāḻvār maṟṟu ellām toḻutu uṇṭu piṉ celpavar
<li><A HREF="f_krl004.htm">{{0039}}</A>  aṟattāṉ varuvatē iṉpam maṟṟu ellām puṟatta pukaḻum ila
<li><A HREF="f_krl003.htm">{{0030}}</A>  antaṇar eṉpōr aṟavōr maṟṟu ev uyirkkum cen taṇmi pūṇṭu oḻukalāṉ
<li><A HREF="f_krl132.htm">{{1316}}</A>  uḷḷiṉēṉ eṉṟēṉ maṟṟu eṉ maṟantīr eṉṟu eṉṉi+ pullāḷ pulattakkaṉaḷ
<li><A HREF="f_krl038.htm">{{0380}}</A>  ūḻiṉ peruvali yā uḷa maṟṟu oṉṟu cūḻiṉum tāṉ muntuṟum
<li><A HREF="f_krl117.htm">{{1166}}</A>  iṉpam kaṭal maṟṟu+ kāmam aḵtu aṭuṅkāl tuṉpam ataṉiṉ peritu
<li><A HREF="f_krl093.htm">{{0923}}</A>  īṉṟāḷ mukattēyum iṉṉātāl eṉ maṟṟu+ cāṉṟōr mukattu+ kaḷi
<li><A HREF="f_krl116.htm">{{1151}}</A>  cellāmi uṇṭēl eṉakku uri maṟṟu niṉ valvaravu vāḻvārkku uri
<li><A HREF="f_krl131.htm">{{1308}}</A>  nōtal evaṉ maṟṟu nontār eṉṟu aḵtu aṟiyum kātalar illāvaḻi
<li><A HREF="f_krl010.htm">{{0095}}</A>  paṇivu uṭiyaṉ iṉcolaṉ ātal oruvaṟku aṇi alla maṟṟu+ piṟa
<li><A HREF="f_krl121.htm">{{1206}}</A>  maṟṟu yāṉ eṉ uḷēṉ maṉṉō avaroṭu yāṉ uṟṟa nāḷ uḷḷa uḷēṉ
</OL>


<P><B>maṟṟum</B> [7 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl059.htm">{{0588}}</A>  oṟṟu oṟṟi+ tanta poruḷiyum maṟṟum ōr oṟṟiṉāl oṟṟi koḷal
<li><A HREF="f_krl038.htm">{{0373}}</A>  nuṇṇiya nūl pala kaṟpiṉum maṟṟum taṉ uṇmi aṟivē mikum
<li><A HREF="f_krl054.htm">{{0540}}</A>  uḷḷiyatu eytal eḷitumaṉ maṟṟum tāṉ uḷḷiyatu uḷḷappeṟiṉ
<li><A HREF="f_krl035.htm">{{0345}}</A>  maṟṟum toṭarppāṭu evaṉkol piṟappu aṟukkal uṟṟārkku uṭampum miki
<li><A HREF="f_krl035.htm">{{0349}}</A>  paṟṟu aṟṟakaṇṇē piṟappu aṟukkum maṟṟum niliyāmi kāṇappaṭum
<li><A HREF="f_krl021.htm">{{0205}}</A>  ilaṉ eṉṟu tīyavi ceyyaṟka ceyyiṉ ilaṉ ākum maṟṟum peyarttu
<li><A HREF="f_krl035.htm">{{0344}}</A>  iyalpu ākum nōṉpiṟku oṉṟu iṉmi uṭimi mayal ākum maṟṟum peyarttu
</OL>


