<P><B>maṉ</B> [7 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl114.htm">{{1138}}</A>  niṟi ariyar maṉ aḷiyar eṉṉātu kāmam maṟi iṟantu maṉṟu paṭum
<li><A HREF="f_krl117.htm">{{1168}}</A>  maṉ uyir ellām tuyiṟṟi aḷittu irā eṉ allatu illi tuṇi
<li><A HREF="f_krl027.htm">{{0268}}</A>  taṉ uyir tāṉ aṟa+ peṟṟāṉi ēṉiya maṉ uyir ellām toḻum
<li><A HREF="f_krl025.htm">{{0244}}</A>  maṉ uyir ōmpi aruḷ āḷvāṟku il eṉpa taṉ uyir añcum viṉi
<li><A HREF="f_krl046.htm">{{0457}}</A>  maṉa nalam maṉ uyirkku ākkam iṉa nalam ellā+ pukaḻum tarum
<li><A HREF="f_krl032.htm">{{0318}}</A>  taṉ uyirkku iṉṉāmi tāṉ aṟivāṉ eṉkolō maṉ uyirkku iṉṉā ceyal
<li><A HREF="f_krl007.htm">{{0068}}</A>  tammiṉ tam makkaḷ aṟivuṭimi mā nilattu maṉ uyirkku ellām iṉitu
