<P><B>maṉa</B> [6 occ.]
<OL>
<li><A HREF="f_krl001.htm">{{0007}}</A>  taṉakku uvami illātāṉ tāḷ cērntārkku allāl maṉa+ kavali māṟṟal aritu
<li><A HREF="f_krl067.htm">{{0661}}</A>  viṉi+ tiṭpam eṉpatu oruvaṉ maṉa+ tiṭpam maṟṟiya ellām piṟa
<li><A HREF="f_krl046.htm">{{0459}}</A>  maṉa nalattiṉ ākum maṟumi maṟṟu aḵtum iṉa nalattiṉ ēmāppu uṭittu
<li><A HREF="f_krl046.htm">{{0458}}</A>  maṉa nalam naṉku uṭiyar āyiṉum cāṉṟōrkku iṉa nalam ēmāppu uṭittu
<li><A HREF="f_krl046.htm">{{0457}}</A>  maṉa nalam maṉ uyirkku ākkam iṉa nalam ellā+ pukaḻum tarum
<li><A HREF="f_krl092.htm">{{0920}}</A>  iru maṉa+ peṇṭirum kaḷḷum kavaṟum tiru nīkkappaṭṭār toṭarpu
